    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_GoingToSeeProfRowan",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What was that about?!\r",
        "Oh, hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Hey! I’m going to see Prof. Rowan!\n",
        "You should come, too! And quickly!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: C’était quoi, ça?!\r",
        "Hé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Je vais voir le Professeur Sorbier!\n",
        "Viens avec moi! Et que ça saute!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_OhJeezForgotSomething",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Oh, jeez!\n",
        "Forgot something!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Oh, mince!\n",
        "J’ai oublié un truc!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalWasLookingForYou1",
      "en_US": [
        "Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was looking for you.\r",
        "I think he’s home now.\n",
        "Why don’t you go check it out?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} te cherchait.\r",
        "Je crois qu’il est chez lui, maintenant.\n",
        "Pourquoi tu ne vas pas vérifier?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalWasLookingForYou2",
      "en_US": [
        "Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was looking for you.\r",
        "I think he’s home now.\n",
        "Why don’t you go check it out?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} te cherchait.\r",
        "Je crois qu’il est chez lui, maintenant.\n",
        "Pourquoi tu ne vas pas vérifier?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalWentTearingOff",
      "en_US": [
        "Hiya, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "You’re looking for {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?\r",
        "He just went tearing off a little\n",
        "while ago.\r",
        "He’s probably not gone too far.\n",
        "Why not go chase after him?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Tu cherches {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?\r",
        "Il est parti à toute vitesse il y a un\n",
        "petit moment.\r",
        "Il n’est probablement pas loin.\n",
        "Tu veux aller le chercher?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_RivalWentTearingOffOuch",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? He went tearing off\n",
        "in a huge rush a while ago.\r",
        "...Ouch. He ran right into me earlier.\n",
        "It’s still hurting.\f",
        "That kid’s growing up tough."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? Il est parti à toute\n",
        "vitesse, il y a un petit moment.\r",
        "Aïe. Il m’a foncé dedans tout à l’heure.\n",
        "Ça fait encore mal.\f",
        "Il devient costaud en grandissant."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_EveryoneGoesOnAdventures",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone goes off on adventures,\n",
        "and then they gradually grow up..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tout le monde part à l’aventure et\n",
        "devient peu à peu adulte..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_WildPokemonAttack",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s true that wild Pokémon do attack\n",
        "people sometimes...\r",
        "But, Pokémon also open their hearts\n",
        "to you, so you can become friends."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est vrai que les Pokémon sauvages\n",
        "attaquent parfois les gens...\r",
        "Mais il arrive également qu’ils\n",
        "leur ouvrent leur cœur."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_YouLookGoodTogether",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! A Pokémon!\n",
        "You look good together!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh! Un Pokémon!\n",
        "Vous allez bien ensemble!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_HelpingPutTogetherPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you’re helping put together\n",
        "a Pokédex?\r",
        "That means you’re going to travel\n",
        "all over the place with Pokémon!\r",
        "That sounds like a lot of fun!\n",
        "I’m a little envious, to be honest!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, tu aides à compléter un Pokédex?\r",
        "Ça veut dire que tu vas voyager par\n",
        "monts et par vaux avec des Pokémon!\r",
        "Ça a l’air marrant! Je t’envie un peu,\n",
        "pour être honnête!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_TechnologyBlowsMeAway",
      "en_US": [
        "Technology just blows me away!\r",
        "I mean, now you can play with people\n",
        "around the world...wirelessly!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La technologie me coupe le souffle!\r",
        "C’est vrai, maintenant, on peut jouer\n",
        "avec des gens du monde entier...\f",
        "sans fil!"
      ]
    },
    {
